<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Honourable Mentions">
    <meta name="keywords" content="game, games, players, adventure">
    <title>Top 5 Video Games</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles/styles.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpg" href="images/favicon.jpg">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <img src="images/logo.png" alt="Logo" class="logo">
        <h1>My Top 5 Video Games</h1>
        <p>
            <a href="#footer">Footer</a>
        </p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <article class="intropara" style="color:white;">
            <h2>Honourable Mentions</h2>
            <section class="gamesection">
                <h2 style="text-align: left;">1. Legend of Zelda: Skyward Sword</h2>
                <img class="gamelistpics" src="images/Zelda.png" alt="logo">
                <p class="newspaper">
                    The Legend of Zelda: Skyward Sword is an action adventure game that follows Link as he travels from his home in 
                    the sky to the world below to rescue Zelda. Along his journey, he battles enemies, solves puzzles and forges the 
                    Master Sword, revealing the origins of the long running conflict between good and evil in the Zelda series.
                </p>
            </section>
            <section class="gamesection">
                <h2 style="text-align: left;">2. Wii Sports/Resort</h2>
                <img class="gamelistpics" src="images/WiiSports.webp" alt="logo">
                <p class="newspaper">
                    Wii Sports and Wii Sports Resort are motion controlled games on the Nintendo Wii where players use a Wii Remote
                    to play activities like tennis, bowling, boxing, basketball etc. The gameplay is simple, fun and creates great memories
                    with family.
                </p>
            </section>
            <section class="gamesection">
                <h2 style="text-align: left;">3. Sea of Thieves</h2>
                <img class="gamelistpics" src="images/SeaOfThieves.jpg" alt="logo">
                <p class="newspaper">
                    Sea of Thieves is an open world pirate adventure game where players explore a shared online ocean, searching
                    for treasure, battling skeletons, and fighting other crews. Players work together to sail ships, complete voyages,
                    and create their own stories through teamwork, exploration, and unpredictable encounters.
                </p>
            </section>
            <section class="contactform">
                <h2>Contact Form</h2>
                <form action="http://foo.com" method="get">
                    <label for="name">Name:</label><br>
                    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required><br><br>
                    <label for="email">Email:</label><br>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required><br><br>
                    <label for="game">Favourite Game:</label><br>
                    <input type="text" id="game" name="game" required><br><br>
                    <button type="submit">Submit</button>
                </form>
            </section>
        </article>
    </main>
    <footer id="footer">
       <iframe class="maps"
            src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d4659.209237317928!2d-8.471363138977049!3d54.27557172263495!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x485ee84f16be97e9%3A0x561c9a1e24565144!2sATU%20Sligo%20Students%27%20Union!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sie!4v1776099721101!5m2!1sen!2sie"
            style="border:0;"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
        </iframe>
        <p>© 2026 Top 5 Video Games</p>
        <p><a href="#top">Back to Top</a></p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>